<title>FRANCE: Sophia convertible bonds listing advanced.</title>
<headline>Sophia convertible bonds listing advanced.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French property financing specialist Sophia said in a statement on Monday that the bourse listing of its new issue of 3.75 percent 2004 convertible bonds was being moved up one day to Monday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
